(Banteay Meanchey): Prime Minister Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on February 20, 2024, introduced strict measures to combat illegal drugs in ministries, institutions and sub-national administrations, and if any government officials and forces Finding that drug will drive you out of the framework.
