Police detain woman after stabbing creditor to death in Oddar Meanchey
(Oddar Meanchey): A female suspect was arrested by the Samrong City Police Force of Oddar Meanchey Provincial Police after she committed murder by beheading a female debtor, causing her death on the spot.
This brutal case happened on March 4, 2024 at around 20:20 at a point in the canal along Street 1 in Doeum Chrey village, Sangkat O Smach, Samrong city, Oddar Meanchey province.
Colonel Horm Phirum, Samrong City Police Inspector, said on March 5, 2024 that the suspect arrested by the police was named Chhoeun Kompheak, 27 years old, residing in Doeum Chrey Village, O'Smach Commune, Samrong City, Oddar Meanchey Province.
The victim was named Hor Sovancharya (aka Oeun), 41 years old. Currently living in a rented room in Thmor Market area in O'Smach village, Sangkat O'Smach, Samrong city, Oddar Meanchey province. Occupation: Employee of O'Smach Resort.
Currently, the above suspects are in charge of building a case to be sent to legal proceedings.
