General Soeng Samnang praised all the female warriors who performed their duties patiently, overcame all obstacles and made all kinds of sacrifices to contribute to the fulfillment of their duties and build a successful unit for the Air Force since Born to the present, as well as involved in the construction and development of these nations, is certainly inseparable from the participation of women forces.
