(Phnom Penh): Mr. Vongsey Visoth, Deputy Prime Minister in charge of the Office of the Council of Ministers, pays a courtesy call on Mr. Son Kunthor, Deputy Prime Minister, who is receiving medical treatment at Calmette Hospital on the afternoon of March 4, 2024.
