Key Remarks by Samdech Hun Manet, Opportunity to Meet with Cambodians Living in Australia and New Zealand
(Melbourne, Australia): The Prime Minister of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, and his Excellency Dr. met with Cambodians living in Australia and New Zealand on the afternoon of March 3, 2024.
The meeting with the Cambodian people there took place during the visit of Prime Minister Hun Manet to the ASEAN-Australia Special Summit from March 1 to 7, 2024.
* Samdech Hun Manet expressed his great pleasure to meet with Cambodians in Australia and New Zealand.
