Samdech Hun Sen considers that the current meeting with Cambodians in Australia and New Zealand shows the solidarity between Cambodians everywhere, which is an important task for the nation-building process.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that Samdech supports all the right to express one's opinion, but must have dignity and respect for each other.
