* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet recalled the rule of the Royal Government led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen in the fight against Kovid 19. Samdech Thipadei reminded that Cambodians do not have a lot of wealth, but Samdech Techo tried to lead the country to protect the lives of the people until the victory of the epidemic of Kovid 19.
* President Hun Manet breathes life, but it is very important for people's lives.
