On that occasion, there was also the participation of representatives of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, representatives of various universities, including the public who registered to observe and the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia (UYFC).
The exam starts at 2:00 pm on subjects related to the Criminal Code, the Criminal Procedure Code, the Anti-Corruption Law and other laws, as well as crime analysis, general knowledge of English and computers.
