Qualified Investment Project Registration System (QIP Online) is a system that allows investors to apply for their Qualified Investment Project (QIP) to the Council for the Development of Cambodia more easily, quickly and transparently through the system. Online.
This QIP Online modernization project is an important project with a long-term vision and high attention of Deputy Prime Minister Sun Chanthol to promote the vision of digitalization in the Council for the Development of Cambodia and implement in accordance with the key priorities of the Royal Government of the second mandate. 7 is "people, roads, water, electricity and technology."
Deputy Prime Minister Sun Chanthol has stated that the QIP Online system will facilitate the registration of investors, reduce any complications and prevent investors from packing documents to the Council for the Development of Cambodia, can be done anywhere with This system.
