The two houses of the Foundation for the Disabled, 4 by 6 meters in size, made of galvanized iron, were handed over to two disabled people named Ly Met, male, 58 years old, with a right leg disability, living in Phum Phum Thmey, Sangkat Rokar Thom, Krong Chbar Morn, Kampong Speu Province, and Lim Leang, a 50-year-old female, was paralyzed by a fall from a tree in Prey Prasat Village, Doeum Rus Commune, Kandal Steung District, Kandal Province.
