In this ceremony, the Disability Foundation also donated from the Disability Fund to the families of people with disabilities who received a new house, each received 100,000 Riels, 25 kg of rice, 2 fish, soy sauce. 2 sticks of Ivy, 1 stick of fish sauce, 2 packets of salt and 1 box of noodles.
