In addition, as well as the protection of aquatic biodiversity such as fish, plants and other natural resources in the water. This is according to the statement made by Dr. Eang Sophalleth, Minister of Environment, during the launching ceremony of the river clean-up campaign and the campaign to install automatic monitoring equipment and data management system in factories at the Ministry on March 1, 2024.
