(Phnom Penh): Dr. Pheung Sakona, Minister of Culture and Fine Arts, on March 1, 2024, on the occasion of the Ministry of International Women's Day, March 8, 113th Anniversary, 2024, said that this day is an event to commemorate and Encourage greater consideration for women and address challenges more effectively.
