Mr. Sun Chanthol said this on the afternoon of February 29, 2024, on the occasion of the High Representative of the Prime Minister of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, closing the meeting to review the work results in 2023 and the work direction for 2024 of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport. Shipping.
