A bowl of beans picks out people who people trust
(Beijing): Democracy is the common value of humanity. After entering the modernization phase, everyone is trying to dig deeper into democracy.
"Our president, our prime minister, must be elected by the National People's Congress and must abide by the National People's Congress," Mao Zedong once summed up.
Until now, in March every year, Chinese people are busy working, doing business and attending school, and also pay attention to the opening of China's two National Congresses through different means and methods, such as liaison offices. At the grassroots level of the People's Assembly, the Internet, telephone, etc. participate in discussions and set expectations.
