Prey Veng Provincial Police: The news that a girl in Kampong Trabek district was robbed of a motorbike as a fiction, driving a fast motorbike and falling into a canal for fear of being blamed by her parents, also lying about the robbery
(Prey Veng): Prey Veng Provincial Police confirmed that after the specialized office of the Criminal Police Plan, in cooperation with the specialized forces of the Kampong Trabek District Police Inspectorate, conducted a thorough investigation throughout the day, there was information about the robbery of a motorcycle from a young woman. 15-year-old Lon Thida was found to be completely fictional and not true.
It should be noted that recently, information and posts were posted on social media that a motorcycle was stolen from a young woman on February 19, 2024 at 5:00 PM in Prey Pdao village, Kampong Trabek commune, Kampong Trabek district, Prey Veng province.
After receiving information that two unidentified suspects robbed a motorcycle from the victim, Lon Thida, living in the commune, the police force under the command of Major General Chhoeun Bunchon, Prey Veng Provincial Police Commissioner. Has conducted a thorough investigation to the scene throughout the day.
After searching the scene, the police found clues to the conclusion that it was not a robbery. After that, the police force invited the victim girl to come for questioning and clarification at the Kampong Trabek District Police Inspectorate.
On suspicion of fabrication, the Kampong Trabek District Police Inspectorate questioned Lon Thida several times, and the girl admitted that the case was not true, that she was the fabricator. This is completely up.
He admitted that he was riding a motorbike too fast and was not careful, which caused a traffic accident in the canal, and he lost consciousness after regaining consciousness. Motorcycles at once.
