1: Allow the owner of the transport company or the owner of the heavy truck with semi-trailer from 6 (six) up to be able to transport on National Road 1 (one) and National Road 2 (two) up to 45 tons from the date of issuance of this instruction until the new legal document.
2. For cars and semi-trailers with less than 6 (six) laps, shall continue to strictly comply with the provisions of the Law on Roads and the relevant legal documents in force.
