* Third: During the low tide, people move to live in the lower part of the gathering, which can be seen in large numbers.
* Fourth: Along with the fluctuations of the tide, public services have also moved to them, such as floating schools, floating health centers and floating Buddhist schools.
* Fifth: These people are not growing like what Facebook has advertised. Authorities and officials have strictly enforced the law and regulations.
Based on the above, Pursat Provincial Administration completely rejects the information published contrary to the facts and undermines the honor and dignity of leaders at all levels, especially the head of the Royal Government, which he always pays attention. On the protection of territorial integrity without fear of exhaustion for the cause of the motherland.
