(Svay Rieng): Samdech Kittisangkhab Dr. Men Sam An, President of the National Council of the United Front for the Development of Motherland Cambodia, in the morning of February 27, 2024, officially inaugurated the Cambodia-Vietnam Friendship Monument in Svay Rieng Province, located in Sangkat Sangkor, Svay Rieng City. Svay Rieng Province.
"The Vietnamese Volunteer Army came to our rescue and freed us from the death of the brutal regime of Pol Pot on January 7, 1979 under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen," he said. The implementation of win-win politics has brought peace to the whole country, people living under the roof of peace.
