Mr. Vongsey Visoth also reminded the working group of the Royal Government to visit Kampong Thom province that the visit was not to seize power at the local level, nor to work on behalf of local authorities, local authorities and authorities of ministries and institutions. To help orient, provide support and enhance capacity to promote better local development.
