(Phnom Penh): Mr. Keo Rattanak, Minister of Mines and Energy, confirmed that the Royal Government under the leadership of Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet, the Prime Minister, continues to create opportunities for electricity providers to provide electricity services, but after receiving the right to invest, It is also obliged to follow the policies, laws, principles, conditions properly, even EDC must apply the same.
