(Banteay Meanchey): A man was arrested by the Poipet City Armed Forces and sent to Banteay Meanchey Provincial Court after he seduced his girlfriend to take nude videos to have sex online and record extortion.
Colonel Nuon Ninaro, Commander of the Municipal Gendarmerie, said that according to the victim, she and the suspect had been in a relationship for a long time and had sex until she was pregnant. Two months later, his mother found out and stopped communicating.
During 2022, she was in contact with the suspect again by calling her on Facebook every day, and the suspect begged her to take off her clothes (naked) and have sex online several times. Because the suspect stole a video of him having sex online and sent it back to the victim to threaten her several times, she decided to file a complaint.
After receiving the complaint, the Poipet City Gendarmerie conducted a search and arrested the suspect, Thoeun Phearin (Tina), 25 years old, false occupation, currently living in O'Neang Village, Orussey Sangkat, Poipet City. Police confiscated a silver CHINA MOBILE4G mobile phone and a video player.
After the arrest, the suspect confessed that he had indeed acted in accordance with the allegations in the complaint. Based on the confession and the nude video, the Municipal Gendarmerie's specialized force builds the case file and sends it to the Provincial Gendarmerie Command for further action.
