Ms. Bandith added that the student, who was an employee in a mobile phone shop, was not allowed to go anywhere because rice and water were already supplied. This student is also the only one who has the right to take from the wholesaler, which means that there are a lot of unofficial online businesses.
Hun Manet's order to inspect gambling venues across the country after comedian Neay Kreung sang and produced a music video to promote online gaming to the public. Due to strong reactions from experts and the public, Neay Kreung released a video apologizing publicly and decided to delete the song from the online game from social media on the evening of February 12, 2024.
This case was also mentioned by Dr. Prum Tevy that because the gambling business takes refuge under the term informal economy, until a big problem arises, it will be resolved. At this point, the Royal Government is not wrong, the game advertisers can not be blamed.
