The master plan has four main goals, including: (1) expanding and improving the scope and capacity of the transport infrastructure system, (2) improving the efficiency and effectiveness of transport services and infrastructure, 3) Promote and improve transport infrastructure to support national development policies; and (4) strengthen service efficiency and logistics costs.
