Khan 7 Makara Authority Inspects DN Spa and Massage Suspected of Gambling
(Phnom Penh): After some social media posted publicly that the DN Spa and massage venue has embedded illegal gambling inside, the forces of Khan 7 Makara Unity Command arrived at the location and checked that there was no such posting. No snooker massage parlors, no gambling-related materials.
Please be informed that the inspection operation took place on the afternoon of February 21, 2024, with the order of Mr. Theng Sothol, Governor of Khan 7 Makara, assigned Mr. Ket Udom, Deputy Governor of Khan to lead the force of Khan Unity Command to inspect directly. The location of DN Spa and Massage is located along the corner of Street 122 and Street 171, Sangkat Mittapheap, Khan 7 Makara, Phnom Penh, but has nothing to do with crime and gambling.
During the inspection, the authorities educated and instructed the owners to manage the location and made a contract with the authorities to prohibit the embedding of all kinds of gambling and other illegal crimes, human trafficking and drugs. . In case of non-compliance with the contract, the authority will follow the legal procedure.
Please also note that on February 14, 2024, Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, ordered all capital-provincial governors throughout the country to immediately inspect all gambling and illegal gambling sites. Must be suppressed.
In addition, Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh, on the afternoon of February 14, 2024, also issued an order to the 14 district authorities as well as the 25 market chiefs not to allow all kinds of illegal gambling to continue in the local area. Its not.
