(Svay Rieng): A violence started due to jealousy caused a man to break a drug, pull out a knife and chase his wife and mother-in-law, causing serious injuries and bloodshed. At 8 pm on February 20, 2024 in Prasop Leak village, Bati commune, Bavet city, Svay Rieng province.
According to the police, the victim, Son Samantha, 28, a female worker living in Prasop Leak village, Bati commune, Bavet city, was severely injured by her husband. Separately, the mother-in-law named Khat Samy, 52 years old, a cleaner in Tuol Yeay Daun, residing in the above-mentioned village (mother-in-law) was stabbed with a knife to cut her left leg and a knife to her head. Left leg and 1 knife to left thigh, serious injuries.
