While the wife escaped from the cutting, she fell to the ground, and the mother ran over her daughter, and the assailant cut the mother-in-law with a knife in the leg and a knife in the left leg, and a knife in the thigh. The left side was seriously injured and the wife was stabbed with a knife from the top of the head to the skull, a knife to the right forearm and a knife to the right ankle. Escape on a motorcycle, escape the shadows.
