* 1: All ministries, institutions and sub-national administrations must increase regular inspections of civil servants, national police officers and soldiers, as well as contracted officers under their supervision on illegal or related drug use. Illegal drugs.
* 2: All ministries, institutions and sub-national administrations shall take action to terminate their positions and dismiss them without exception for civil servants, national police officers and soldiers, as well as any contracted officials who are found to be in use. Illegal drugs or related to illegal drugs.
* 3: The application of disciplinary sanctions does not impede the implementation of criminal sanctions in accordance with the laws and regulations in force.
