Political parties, even on behalf of the opposition, have issued petitions in support of anti-drug measures in ministries, institutions and sub-national administrations.
At the same time, the Khmer National Unity Party believes that in order to eradicate drugs and eradicate drug use, only the eradication of all civil servants will be the best example for the people throughout the country.
Turning to social media, many people who were aware of the Royal Government's measures to fight drugs in ministries, institutions and sub-national administrations also applauded and expressed their happiness.
