(Phnom Penh): The visit of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Chairman of the Supreme Council of the King, to visit Mr. Thaksin to the Central Palace in Bangkok, Thailand, not only shocked the news in Cambodia, but also shocked the media. Thailand, regional and global news as well.
On February 21, 2024, Samdech Techo Hun Sen traveled by special plane to Bangkok, Thailand to visit Thaksin, who was just released by the court on February 18.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen became the first foreign guest to fly to visit Thaksin. The meeting between the influential former prime ministers of Cambodia and Thailand has become an interesting event in Cambodian and Thai society and continues to be of interest to the region and the world.
In Cambodia, all media in both Khmer and foreign languages highlight the image of the meeting between Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Thaksin, accompanied by the content of the closeness between the two influential politicians. In Thailand, too, the Thai media has taken an interest in the event and has taken their respective angles.
However, this post does not have much content other than to describe the close and deep relationship between Samdech Techo and Thaksin, as well as the description of the meeting and quotes posted by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on social media .
According to Samdech Techo Hun Sen on social media, the meeting with Thaksin was not about politics, but about the 32 years of our friendship since 1992.
Mr. Preap Kol added that Samdech Techo Hun Sen is not only fully capable and has special talents, worthy of being the supreme leader, but also a great virtue. In fact, Samdech treats friends or relatives not only when that friend or dharma has power, but also in other situations, he still maintains friendships and emotions as friends, brothers, sisters and family.
It should be noted that Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Mr. Thaksin have a deep relationship and have been brothers since 1992 before Mr. Thaksin became Prime Minister.
After being overthrown in a coup in 2006, Thaksin remained close to Hun Sen and was appointed adviser. During his stay abroad, Thaksin and his family flew to Cambodia to meet with Samdech Techo Hun Sen frequently.
In August 2023, before returning to the country, Thaksin and his sister Yingluck also appeared at Samdech Techo's home to celebrate his birthday. After Thaksin entered the country and was arrested, Yingluck was also seen appearing at Samdech's house.
Through the history of the relationship, this shows the deep and close relationship between Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Thaksin and his family. Through this relationship, it is said that Samdech Techo is also an important key in Thaksin's political life, especially the key that helped Thaksin to return from exile, return to prison and become a prisoner. You are free.
