(Banteay Meanchey): On February 21, 2024, Serei Sophorn Municipal Gendarmerie Base Force led by Brigadier General Sok Leng, Municipal Gendarmerie Local Commander, patrolled to maintain order and security for the people in the geographical area.
When patrolling at Rong Masin village, O'Ambel commune, Serey Sophorn city, the force found 2 groups of gangsters, about 8 of them, chasing each other anarchically, immediately the local police force of Serey Sophorn Detained a suspect and seized an 84-cm-long knife and a stick and brought it to the Municipal Gendarmerie Base for questioning.
