Col. Sok Leng said that the suspect, after being detained and interrogated, confessed that he was involved in the chase. Based on the confession and the actual action, the local force of the Municipal Gendarmerie has built a case and sent it to the Provincial Gendarmerie Command to proceed with the procedure, while the other fugitives are still being searched and detained by the force.
