The Governor emphasized that for all citizens, employees, employers and young people must be very careful to participate in fire prevention, because fire prevention is not the duty of anyone, but it is our duty. All together.
In addition, all homes should have fire extinguishers and be prepared with simple equipment such as blankets, sand, water, full jars, hoses, motors, pumps, water pumps are better for extinguishing when There was a fire the first time. At the same time, beware of smoke through the use of stoves, burning candles, electricity, chemicals, explosive gases (gas stoves and gas canisters) and so on.
He claimed that if there is a fire or other risk, please immediately report to the nearest competent authority to intervene in a timely and effective manner.
Please be informed that this day celebration also has a demonstration by the officers of the specialized police office about simple methods to prevent firefighting that can allow people to save themselves first.
