Samdech reminded that in the past as well as now, Samdech also contributed to help artists who are experiencing difficulties through the association and personally. "Considering that the budget to support the association to help solve the association's difficulties is still a big challenge," he said. Therefore, if Duke Leng Navatra is the president of the association, we can solve a large part, including the office of the association.
