3. The Spokesperson of the Prime Minister would like to emphasize that the Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, has nothing to do with the multi-million City Company and the Association of Workers and Ex-Workers for the Charity of Duke Leng Channa. .
