(Phnom Penh): On February 20, 2024, at the Office of the Mines Authority, on behalf of Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, Prime Minister and Chairman of the Mines Authority, Dr. Ly Thuch, Senior Minister and First Vice President of the Mines Authority, granted Mr. Igor Driesmans, Chairman of the Committee The EU Delegation to Cambodia and his colleagues paid a courtesy call and discussed work on mine action cooperation in Cambodia.
During the meeting, on behalf of the Royal Government, the Senior Minister expressed his deep gratitude to the European Union for its support to Cambodia's progress so far, as well as to some EU member states that have contributed to the field of mine action. Humanitarian in Cambodia since 1992 in contributing to the provision of safe land, reducing the risk rate and improving the living standards of local people.
