Meeting Hall of the Department of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, Siem Reap Province, February 19, 2024. Letter to readers: Democracy is the choice of a people in the context of that country
What are the choices of the Cambodian people?
The choice is as stated in the preamble of the Constitution: "We, the Cambodian people, have awakened, stood firm, united, resolute, united, strengthened national unity, defended Cambodian territory, precious sovereignty and civilized Angkor to build a nation." "Koh Santepheap" is based on a liberal, multi-party democracy, guarantees human rights, respects the rule of law, and is responsible for the future destiny of the nation so that it can grow, prosper and prosper forever.
In this sense, under the shadow of peace since 1998, Cambodia has been at the forefront of its destiny by holding regular elections on a regular basis as stated in Article 78 of the Constitution. Article 76 of the Constitution provides for the secrecy of elections. Confidentiality is one of the conditions for free, fair and just elections, plus:
* Every citizen has equal rights to stand as a candidate * Every citizen has equal right to form a political party * Every citizen and all political party have equal right to free political expression * Security mechanisms for candidates during the election campaign and during the election and * Security mechanisms during the election.
According to the press release of the National Election Committee (NEC) as of yesterday, February 16, 2024, which is the 7th day of the election campaign for the 5th term of the Senate, the campaign took place. Smooth, safe, secure, orderly and non-violent.
What is the true heart of democracy?
The real heart is free, fair and just elections, and free, fair and just elections must include the above conditions.
Is the United States the father of democracy? Do the 27 EU countries really have the same democracy, or is Germany different from France?
The end of the Cold War was the spread of American democracy, and Europe was striving to promote democracy to the world, but for Dominique TRINQUAND, the current evolution of the United States was impossible, and Europe shifted from undeveloped democracy to defending democracy. Its only.
So the choice of the Cambodian people is to continue to take care of what we have, rather than wanting too much, as a proverb says, one bird in one hand is better than twenty birds in the forest.
