Mr. Pen Bona highlighted the detailed achievements of the following six priority policies:
At this point, Mr. Pen Bona claimed that the purpose of Samdech Thipdey is not only to provide health services to everyone, but also to provide quality services, that is, doctors who are good at diagnosing and prescribing the right medicine and quality medicine.
