(Phnom Penh): From 12 to 18 February 2024, for one week, the authorities of the Ministry of Interior launched a crackdown on gambling in a total of 148 cases, arrested 187 people involved, including sent to court 13 people and 174 people were instructed to sign contracts. This is according to Mr. Touch Sok (Sok), Deputy Spokesman of the Ministry of Interior.
