The Prime Minister added that in the past, in addition to fabricating cases of kidnapping, some foreigners had also fabricated cases of organ trafficking in Cambodia for personal gain, but all of these cases had also been fabricated. Cambodian authorities research and reveal the truth to the public, especially international opinion, to avoid misunderstandings and misconceptions about Cambodia.
