After the arrest on the morning of February 17, 2024, the specialized force sent the suspect named Thou Kling to the Mondulkiri Provincial Court.
According to the company's financial statements for the fourth quarter of 2023, profits increased significantly compared to the previous year, which indicates the strong financial health and successful operation of the company.
