(Phnom Penh): If you have to be vaccinated by a doctor to treat a disease or save a life, know that you owe this animal life because the substance in the medicine is extracted from their blood.
Antelopes do not have an antibody system and can not produce antibiotics to fight infections, but in their blood there is a wonderful ingredient that can stop the spread of bacteria and viruses by freezing bacteria. Around them. It is the substance that can cause the virus to be produced as LAL in the pharmaceutical industry.
It is explained that if you want to check for contamination in any medical device, just check with LAL and if it does not freeze, it means it is free of germs.
In order to get blood clots, they have to catch thousands of them a week and bring them to the laboratory alive. In the laboratory, more than 30% of the blood was pumped, but it was able to recover quickly when it was released into the sea. They are pumped once a year and their blood is vacuum-cooled before being exported to countries around the world.
