Kandal Provincial Administration Continues to Hold a Meeting to Inspect and Crack Down on All Types of Illegal Gambling in Ang Snoul District
(Kandal): Mr. Hak Sok Makara, Deputy Governor of Kandal Province and Deputy Chairman of the Provincial Administrative Unity Command, inspected and chaired a meeting of the Ang Snoul District Administrative Unity Command to inspect and order the crackdown on all types of gambling sites. The law allows.
He ordered this in the meeting on the afternoon of February 16, 2024, with the participation of the three forces, the chairman of the district council, district governor, deputy district governor, commune chief, police chief, commune administration and all relevant officials. Also.
The Deputy Governor has made a definite plan to crack down on all unauthorized locations and do not be afraid of who has the backbone, because we have the strongest backbone of the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Hun Manet, the Prime Minister of Cambodia.
The Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet, has issued an order suspending the issuance of licenses or the granting of the right to open local gambling venues.
At the same time, the President instructed the Gambling Management Commission of Cambodia under the Ministry of Economy and Finance to convene an urgent meeting with law enforcement forces and authorities, including all relevant parties, to review and reorganize the principles and measures governing gambling. Lucky adventures across the country.
In this regard, the Prime Minister has ordered all provincial governors to take immediate action to inspect gambling venues at the local level of their jurisdiction, in case of any recent reopening, please take immediate action to close and report Come to the prince to take further action that can lead to the revocation of the license in the province or throughout the country.
