(Oddar Meanchey): Prof. Tan Vouch Chheng, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health and Prof. Tung Rathavy, Advisor of the Ministry of Health, accompanied by Dr. Khlok Huot, Advisor of the Ministry of Health and Director of the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Health Department, and other relevant officials inspected the provision of health services. Referral hospitals and some health centers in the districts in Oddar Meanchey province.
Dr. Khlok Huot said on the afternoon of February 16, 2024 that, under the guidance of Professor Chheang Ra, Minister of Health, senior officials of the Ministry visited referral hospitals and health centers in the districts. In Oddar Meanchey province from 14 to 16 February 2024.
The Director of Oddar Meanchey Provincial Health Department stated that the direct visit of the leaders of the Ministry of Health to referral hospitals and health centers in Oddar Meanchey is in order to improve the quality of services in health centers in the province in accordance. The Royal Government's Pentagon Strategy for the 7th Legislature of the National Assembly, which focuses on the provision of services in health centers and referral hospitals as a top priority.
Mr. Khlok Huot said that the current quality of service in health centers is focused on strengthening the environmental infrastructure around the health center, professional ethics and responsible service, Equipped with equipment, facilities and medicine, strengthening work discipline and 24 hours / 7 days, and human resource management and capacity building, professionalism and technology.
On that occasion, Ms. Tan Vuoch Chheng and her team also met and greeted the patients and their families who came to receive services in the health center. She also conveyed the greetings from the Minister of Health and thanked all health officials throughout Oddar Meanchey for their efforts to provide health services and care and treatment to the people responsibly.
According to Dr. Khlok Huot, there are two referral hospitals in Oddar Meanchey province: Provincial Referral Hospital and Anlong Veng Referral Hospital, 39 health centers, one health post and two OD offices.
