In front of national and international journalists, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun said that the two Taiwanese Chinese arrived in Cambodia on February 11, 2024 to produce a video of the arrest and post it on their social media to Attract visitors and for the benefit of selling products in their country.
According to the provincial governor, according to the interrogation, the two suspects claimed that when they arrived in Cambodia, they planned to make this video in Phnom Penh, but the building they arrived at was not suitable for filming. Recently relocated to Sihanoukville.
After arriving in Sihanoukville, they went to a building on Otres Beach and made a video and posted live on social media, pretending that he had been detained and tortured, but that he had escaped. Outside. After seeing such a video, he immediately ordered a specialized search force.
Mr. Kouch Chamroeun added that after careful research, the specialized force under the command of Lt. Gen. Ratha determined their location and was arrested on February 14, 2024 yesterday. . He confirmed that according to their plan, after performing in Sihanoukville, they planned to go to Siem Reap, but have not yet been arrested by the police.
In this regard, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun emphasized that through the video that they performed in captivity, it has seriously affected the honor and image of Cambodia, especially in Cambodia, while people and tourists are walking and living. Safely under the shadow of peace of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
As for the legal action against the two Chinese-Taiwanese suspects, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun claimed that he would take strict action by sending them to the provincial court to be punished according to Cambodian law and then deported to their country of origin.
At the same time, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun also sent a message to the people as well as tourists who are visiting or planning to visit Cambodia, especially Sihanoukville, do not worry, security, order and safety are well guaranteed. And can go for a walk without any fear.
In addition, he also called on journalists to participate in eliminating false information that harms the honor and security of the order in Cambodia, that is, to participate in promoting what is a tourist destination to national and international media. Attract tourists to come and enjoy.
