* Location 1: At the location where the baby was abandoned. * Location 2: In front of Sangkat Choam Chao III * Location 3: In front of Por Sen Chey District Hall * Location 4: In front of the Department of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation Phnom Penh.
Authorities said that if the parents or anyone involved with the baby was notified, please contact the adoptee immediately. As proof that the parents or those involved with the baby, please bring with you a letter from the local authority, village, commune / sangkat to the district / Khan.
