(Kampong Cham): On the afternoon of February 14, 2024, Prof. Chheang Ra, Minister of Health, paid a working visit to Speu Health Center, Svay Teap Health Center, Chamkar Leu Referral Hospital and Kampong Cham Provincial Hospital.
On that occasion, inspecting the health work of Kampong Cham province, the Minister also met with patients who came to receive consultation services and are being treated in health centers, referral hospitals and provincial hospitals.
After inspecting the work and visiting the patients, the Minister also had a talk with the leaders, officials, health workers, with the participation of Mr. Un Chanda, Governor of Kampong Cham Provincial Board of Governors.
On that occasion, the Minister stated the key points that focus on the results of health services to the people through the strengthening of better health infrastructure, the provision of additional medical equipment, capacity building for diagnostic support. And the effectiveness of medical care, including monitoring and strengthening human resources to meet the continuous needs of the people.
The Minister also commended the health officials for dedicating their time, energy and hard work to provide health care services to the people with a professional ethics.
In order to strengthen the capacity and develop quality and effective skills in providing health services to the people, Professor Chheang Ra provided nine additional key messages, including:
1: Finding ways to improve skills
2: How to find the right answer or solution
3: Learn from our work and learn how to evaluate their work to improve from day to day.
4: To build strength and find new things to develop more.
5: Review the time spent on your own work
6: Making the right decision
9: For a better tomorrow, until we understand the past to find clues or shortcomings.
