With the opening of the first Stung Sreng Reservoir, Mr. Nhen Kuon, Director of Oddar Meanchey Provincial Department of Water Resources and Meteorology, also requested farmers who are growing dry rice in Phnom Srok, Preah Net Preah, Banteay Meanchey and Srey Snom districts. Kralanh district, Siem Reap province, please pay attention to the water received from Oddar Meanchey province, use it for the purpose and use it sparingly.
