(Phnom Penh): On February 14, 2024, the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries organized an exhibition of agricultural products, especially safe and organic vegetables in front of the Ministry.
This is the second year that the Ministry has organized this program with 21 participating booths. This number is higher than last year after receiving support from the general population and requests from farm enterprises that grow and process agricultural products.
The purpose of this exhibition is to make the general public interested in Cambodian agricultural products that are quality and safe, especially to provide options for people to buy safe vegetables for loved ones.
Providing safe vegetable baskets or flower baskets instead of flower bouquets not only shows the buyer's attention to the recipient, but also shows support and encouragement to the farmers who work hard to grow vegetables on the farm. Animals and enterprises produce quality and safe agricultural products to serve the needs of the general population, especially to ensure the safety and well-being of consumers.
Taiwan reports joint patrols between Chinese air force and navy near the island
BEIJING (Reuters) - Taiwan's Defense Ministry on Wednesday reported that it had spotted 14 Chinese military aircraft operating near Taiwan, and that they were participating in patrols to strengthen combat readiness with the Chinese navy. . This was released by Reuters on Wednesday, February 14, 2024.
As of about 1 p.m. Wednesday, it had spotted a total of 14 Chinese military aircraft, including J-16 fighter jets and drones, operating near the north and northwest, the Taiwan Defense Ministry said. Taiwan. Nine of the planes flew over the median line of the Taiwan Strait and cooperated with the Chinese navy to conduct joint patrols to strengthen joint combat readiness.
(Phnom Penh): Mobile phone users have expressed boredom with mobile phone companies that often send promotional messages and encourage online gaming.
Recently, an online gambling company called "5T5T" has been sending messages to people's mobile phones in almost every system, showing the company's special program as an incentive to go to the website to create a gaming account.
This message is sent to the phone every weekend. Citizens have expressed frustration with the message, saying it would be a violation of their right to use it.
The student considered the actions of the mobile phone company as a violation of his right to use because he paid a monthly service fee, but the company took additional business, regardless of whether the owner of the phone number is needed or not. Send to that?
Vann Ponleung applauded the action of the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet, to ban the deployment of additional gambling venues. This action will contribute to maintaining security, order and eliminating theft in society.
Vann Ponleung also expects that after the voice message of the President, the phone company will not violate the rights of users and send messages encouraging them to play the game again.
The head of the Rice Federation revealed some of the main factors driving the increase in rice exports from Cambodia to Europe earlier this year, the first month of rice exports to Europe reached 250,000 tons.
(Phnom Penh): Chairman of the Board of the Rice Federation of Cambodia said that in 2024, rice exports to markets in the European Union, a significant increase, more than 50% of total exports. Cambodia's first month, although shipments from Cambodia to Europe are hampered by the war between Israel and Hamas.
According to the report of the Cambodian Rice Federation in January 2024, Cambodia's rice exports to 22 EU countries amounted to more than 25,000 tons, amounting to 18.85 million US dollars, namely the community market. Europe accounted for 54% of total exports in January, a good increase.
Oknha Song Saran, Chairman of the Board of the Cambodian Rice Federation, told Fresh News that the main reason for the increase in rice exports from Cambodia to the European market was due to the re-payment of tariff preferences from Europe. Cambodia has a delicious taste that Asians living in Europe like to eat.
He also said that the war between Israel and Hamas in Gaza, despite the obstacles to the shipment of goods from Cambodia to Europe, but also partly boosted rice orders from Cambodia. However, some buyers are concerned about supply and delivery, thus urging some countries in need of rice to reserve rice in case they have stockpiled rice in their own country.
However, he worries that the protracted war between Israel and Hamas will continue to push up shipping costs, affecting some importers who depend on rice supplies from Asian countries.
Chea Chandara, President of the Association of Freight Traders, told Fresh News on February 13, 2024 that after the threat from Houthi rebels in the Red Sea, the cost of transporting goods from Cambodia to Europe tripled. Of the normal price, the normal price is just over $ 3,000, but now it has risen to more than $ 9,000 to more than $ 10,000 per foot, because the ship has to cross the road and open longer shipping time.
