He stressed that professional officials and municipal authorities must be held accountable before the law. On the other hand, the professional officer must check the law clearly, if the company or the gambling place has the law and we must allow it.
Mr. Nguon Reasey continued that this is the common policy of the head of the Royal Government to inform all operators that in order to avoid problems in the implementation of legal procedures, the company must have a law implemented by the Commission on all commercial gambling. Cambodia and a law can only be issued in one location. If there is no law, please suspend immediately and otherwise will have to build a case to send to court.
