Two killed in traffic accident in Kampong Trabek district, Prey Veng province
(Prey Veng): A horrific accident caused two couples to die suddenly while traveling from home on a motorcycle to work in Phnom Penh and hit the back of a broken rice truck parked on the road without lights.
This case happened at 3:00 AM on February 13, 2024 at the intersection of National Road No. 1, Kor Anteak Market in Prasat Village, Prasat Commune, Kampong Trabek District, Prey Veng Province.
According to the report, prior to the incident, the couple, living in Banlea Set village, Kraol Kor commune, Svay Chrum district, Svay Rieng province, left home on a motorbike to work in Phnom Penh and met with a traffic accident. A broken rice truck parked on the side of the road killed both husband and wife.
According to the report, the reason for the accident was that a large rice processing truck was damaged and parked on the sidewalk of National Road No. 1 without any signs or reflections.
After the incident, the competent force came down to measure the two exhibits and kept them at the Police Inspectorate of Kampong Trabek District for later handling, while the bodies of the two couples were taken by relatives for a traditional ceremony in their hometown. Kraol Ko commune, Svay Chrum district.
