Ministry of Land Management announces the implementation of special investment promotion program in Sihanoukville 2024
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction has issued a notification on the implementation of a special investment promotion program in Sihanoukville 2024. This is according to the announcement received by Fresh News on February 13, 2024.
According to the announcement, the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction will simplify the procedures and procedures and reduce the time to apply for and issue construction permits, construction permits, construction site closures or construction use certificates to owners. Construction in Sihanoukville.
In order to effectively implement the above special program, the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction will assign professional officers to inspect and certify the architectural design project, construction component design project, construction work and construction quality and safety inspection work in case the construction owner does not Have a letter or report from a company that has a construction inspection and certification license.
The Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction will assign a technical team to be stationed at the Department of Land Management, Urban Planning, Construction and Cadastral Affairs in Sihanoukville and at the OWSO of the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction to provide information and services as needed. .
