(Kampong Speu): General Ith Sarath, Deputy Commander of the Joint Chiefs of Staff of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF), on February 13, 2024, closed the workshop to summarize the work results of 2023 and the work direction for 2024 of the Active Officers' School. .
On this occasion, General Ith Sarath would like to bring greetings from Samdech Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, General Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of National Defense, General Vong Pisen, Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces to officers, deputies and soldiers. Soldiers of the school, all active officers.
General Ith Sarath said that it is very important for all units and schools to review the annual work results and set the direction to continue to evaluate the activities that have been carried out in the past and reflect the strengths, weaknesses and The remaining points that should be taken into account, strive to implement, in particular, gather all the ideas by suggesting and participating in discussions.
General Ith Sarath also made some recommendations to the leaders of the active military academy, including:
First, continue to lead the school and educate all officers, lieutenants and soldiers to maintain the peace of the country by respecting the law, respecting the rules and regulations of the army and always being loyal to the nation, religion, the King, and participating in the implementation and support. All strategies and policies of the Royal Government, in particular, support the leadership of the Royal Government under the wise and skillful leadership of Samdech Hun Manet.
Second: Continue to build schools to be suitable as a training ground for human resources of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, such as: Construction of new buildings and fields according to the needs of each skill to serve training, especially the training of new technology to serve pedagogy. Teaching that is easy for the military and makes the trainees easy to understand, easy to understand and easy to remember.
Third: In addition, the school must pay attention to some other work, such as:
* Educate all soldiers to accept the assignment of new roles according to the structure of the Institute of Command, Staff and the appointment of officers according to the structure of the Institute in accordance with the capabilities of each soldier in a transparent and fair manner. Strengthen solidarity, unity and harmony in the successful implementation of tasks.
Fourth, to set up a research team to revise the pedagogical teaching of new technologies and to cooperate with the specialized office on document editing in accordance with the evolving situation of the new war as well as the rapidly evolving military technology and equipment. Recent: Daun, War, Technology, etc. to study and prepare documents in accordance with current war tactics.
