(Phnom Penh): Mr. Peng Po, Minister of Public Works and Transport, led a delegation of the Ministry of Public Works, Transport, Civil Aviation, Post, Telecommunication, Industry, Science, Technology, Innovation, Mining, Energy and Trade on Tuesday morning, February 13, 2024. The National Urban and Construction Territories of the National Assembly, known as "C9" under the leadership of Mrs. Nin Saphon, Chairman of the Commission.
