The Ministry of Inspection inspects various ministries / institutions and sub-national administrations, both good and bad. If the institution is found to be good, the Ministry will help to disseminate it as a model, but if the inspection is wrong, the Ministry of Inspection will continue the procedure. If the procedure is minor, the institution will be instructed, educated and corrected, but if it is serious, it must be thoroughly researched and reported to the Prime Minister to take action.
