(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Tuesday, February 13, 2024, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, presided over the closing ceremony of the 2023 work review meeting. And raise the work direction for 2024 of the Ministry of Inspection.
The Ministry of Inspection held a meeting to review the work of 2023 and raise the work direction of 2024 on the morning of February 12, 2024. The opening ceremony was presided over by Mr. Huot Hak, Minister of Inspection.
The following are the main contents of Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet, the opportunity to close the meeting to review the work of the Ministry of Inspection:
* Samdech Thep Dey, please appreciate the achievements of the Ministry in 2023. Of course, these successes do not come by chance, but they are the result of unremitting concerted efforts, realism in the spirit of unity, internal unity and cooperation of leaders and civil servants. All levels of the Ministry of Inspection.
* Samdech Hun Sen Manet encourages us to continue to prepare and implement new plans in a consistent manner with the goals of the inspection sector in order to continue to improve inspection work and encourage more active participation from all ministries and institutions and stakeholders. To achieve the vision of good governance and high quality institutions and institutions in Cambodia.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the main core of the Royal Government, both the old legislature and the new legislature is good governance, that is, clean house before doing other work.
* Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet stated that the renaming of the Ministry of Inspection is to sharpen the role of the Ministry to be sharper, leading to the staff of the Royal Government on governance.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the inspection work is contributing to the implementation of the first four approaches.
* Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet stated that do not consider the Ministry of Inspection as a binding institution.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet stated that regular monitoring and evaluation is to make the implementation of action plans more effective.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that in order for the inspection work to get good results, attention must be paid to human resources, work mechanisms and legal standards.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet recommends reviewing the inspection mechanism so as not to overlap each other's roles and responsibilities.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet advised to build the inspection law to come into force in 2024.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet requested Ministries, Institutions and Sub-National Administration to cooperate with the Ministry of Inspectors to improve the work, do not be afraid and escape from the work of inspection.
* Samdech Manipur Hun Manet expects that in 2024, the state administration system is not based on individuals but on the labor system.
