(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chhay Rithi Sen, Minister of Rural Development, instructed the leaders in charge of the first program, the Technical Director General of the specialized units and the Capital-Provincial Departments of Rural Development to make more efforts to study more about new products, raw materials and related technologies. With the construction of rural roads to ensure good quality, durability, longevity and all seasons.
This introduction was made in the workshop on the use of raw materials and new Stabilizer technology "on the morning of February 8, 2024. The workshop was attended by a total of 349 Zoom Meeting participants from the Permanent Secretary of State, the Under Secretary of State, the Director General of the Department of Rural Roads, the Laboratory, the Project Manager, the National Road Inspectors and the Sub-National Road Inspectors through the Zoom Meeting.
