(Phnom Penh): Mr. Yich Samith, Member of the National Election Committee (NEC), said that for the security work to be highly effective and organized a force to protect the election campaign for the 5th legislature senator 2024. NEC using a total of 15,724 members.
Mr. Yich Samith made this statement when he chaired a meeting with stakeholders to disseminate two important issues related to the 5th Senate Election 2024: First: The launch of Election campaign and second: maintaining security, safety and public order during the election campaign on February 08, 2024.
Mr. Yich Samith said, "The target to prevent the election campaign is in all 25 capitals and provinces for 14 days from 10 to 23 February 2024, and the total force to be used is 15,724. The people who are involved are: administrative police stations, communes, sangkats, municipal police inspectorates, districts, Khans, local military police, municipalities, districts, Khans and sub-districts, municipalities, districts and Khans.
