(Svay Rieng): Svay Rieng Provincial Chamber of Commerce has decided to build a boat dock in Krasaing Chrum village, Krous commune, Svay Chrum district, Svay Rieng province to facilitate the transportation of rice in Svay Rieng province as well as farmers. Rice in the dry season.
In addition, a road was built for rice trucks to enter the boat dock, as well as scales for weighing rice, which traders as well as people who export rice to sell to Vietnamese rice traders.
Mr. Sok Rado, President of Svay Rieng Provincial Chamber of Commerce, said on the afternoon of February 7, 2024 that the purpose of this boat dock is to make it easier for farmers to use as a place to transfer rice from farmers to cars. Your boat buys rice from Vietnam in Svay Chrum district, as well as other places in the province to sell to Vietnamese buyers, because now the price of rice is going up, and if there is a clear place, it is easy to manage.
At the same time, an official of the provincial administration also said that according to the recommendation of the Governor of Svay Rieng to find a market for rice to local farmers, so make it easier for people to sell his rice. The season should not be late, because rice is currently high in the market, making them have a high income to reduce poverty in the family to some extent.
The people as well as the traders who bring the rice to sell are also happy because there is a clear berth for boats in and out, easy to transport rice to sell, cost less to transport in the area. The mouth of the border.
It should be noted that the rice that farmers sell to Vietnamese traders is not resold elsewhere, only rice in the border area, and the framework for this cooperation is only between provinces.
