(Phnom Penh): At around 9 pm on Wednesday, February 7, 2024, His Excellency Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and His Excellency Dr. Pech Chanmony Hun Manet, His Excellency, led a high-level delegation of the Royal Government of Cambodia to return home. Retire back to Cambodia safely after concluding a one-day official visit to Bangkok, Thailand.
