(Kampong Thom): A 4-year-old boy was trapped in a school bus for more than 4 hours until he suffocated to death. The incident took place on the evening of February 5, 2024 at the Kolbot Panha International School, located in Prey Preal (A) Village, Trapeang Russey Commune, Kampong Svay District, Kampong Thom Province.
According to the report, the victim boy named Yom Raya lives in Trach village, Tbeng commune, Kampong Svay district. While the driver of the school bus, Long Sineth, a 42-year-old female (escaped after the incident).
According to the description of the scene, Chhit Sophoan and his wife Long Sineth run a private school called Kolbot Panha International School and often drive home every day, sometimes with their husbands and sometimes their wives.
On the day of the incident, at around 1:00 PM, Long Sineth, when he returned from transporting students as usual, opened the car door for the students and handed it over to the teacher and confirmed that some students did not come to school today and the teacher started teaching. Normal.
Until 4:30 pm, the students had to be taken back, suddenly found a boy trapped in the car, lost consciousness. At that time, Long Sineth took the victim to the hospital, but when he arrived, the doctor told him that the victim was dead. Later, she called her husband to continue driving and escaped, while he called the police and handed over everything to his family.
This case has left a lot of sadness and sympathy for the child victim, who was only 4 years old and was falling in love with his parents and family. And this is also an additional experience for all school bus drivers before closing the car door to check all angles to confirm that students get out of the car or not.
