His Excellency Hun Manet said, "On the one hand, we control the situation, because in each country, controlling the situation helps the people, helping to stabilize the national economy, because the national economy depends on the people." "We can not have a state with macroeconomic stability if people's livelihoods are unstable if people's livelihoods are unstable."
