In recent years, the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation has implemented five social assistance interventions in the following stages of crisis:
This statement by Samdech Hun Sen was made on the occasion that Samdech presided over the closing ceremony of the 2023 work review meeting and the 2024 work direction of the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation on February 6, 2024. .
Samdech emphasized that the introduction of social protection policy is not only to create a culture of giving fish to the people, but the state has also invested in many areas so that people can feed themselves, that is, when Where people can afford to feed themselves, they will be able to feed the state, and the state will turn to those who cannot afford to feed themselves to grow together.
