The writing test took place on January 28, 2024 at the Royal University of Law and Economics, with 1,746 candidates and 146 absent candidates (46 females). Held at the revision center of the Royal School of Administration from the morning of January 29, 2024.
The sports practice exam started on the afternoon of January 29, 2024 at the National Institute of Physical Education and Sports, with 1,724 candidates and 168 absent candidates (53 females).
The 100 selected candidates are for 21 target provinces. The committee also selected 10 reserve candidates in each province, except for Mondulkiri, which has 6 reserve candidates and 8 in Stung Treng province.
Candidates who are not satisfied with the results and wish to request a review of their worksheets can submit a written request to the General Department of Public Function Management of the Ministry of Public Function.
The Ministry of Public Works will issue a decision to officially recognize candidates to continue the procedure of training at the National Institute of Physical Education and Sports and provide a framework in accordance with the normative documents in force.
Please also be informed that after the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports has started the training and in case there is a successful candidate abandoning the framework, the Ministry can select the reserve candidate with the highest score in the province to replace. This alternative is only valid for two weeks after the start of the training.
The competition was attended by inter-ministerial leaders, sub-committees, experts and journalists to witness the examination process from the beginning to the end of the announcement of results.
