Russia, China accuse US of igniting escalating tensions in Middle East
Russia and China have accused the United States during a UN Security Council meeting on Monday (February 5, New York time) of inciting tensions in the Middle East. East with retaliatory attacks on Iranian-backed armed movements in Syria and Iraq recently. This is according to a release by the AFP news agency.
The U.S. military on Friday night launched airstrikes on several targets in Syria and Iraq in retaliation for a drone strike that killed three US soldiers in Jordan on Friday. January 28
The airstrikes, targeting Iranian forces and the Iranian-backed armed movement, have been raising fears that the war between Israel and Hamas in the Gaza Strip could escalate into a full-blown war in the Middle East. The White House on Sunday also confirmed that the United States plans to launch more retaliatory strikes.
Outrage over the war between Israel and Hamas, which erupted on October 7, 2023, stemmed from Hamas attacks and has escalated across the Middle East. Violence in Lebanon, Iraq, Syria and Yemen. Photo: Reuters Keynote Speech by President Hun Manet Opening Ceremony
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Tuesday, February 6, 2024, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, presided over the closing ceremony of the 2023 work review meeting. And set the work direction for 2024 of the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation.
The following are the main contents of Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet, the opportunity to close the meeting to review the work in 2023 and raise the work direction in 2024 of the Ministry of Social Affairs:
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet praised the achievements of the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation in 2023.
* President Hun Manet stated that Cambodia and other countries in the world are suffering from the global crisis, which requires the Royal Government to pay attention to achieve the vision of Samdech Techo to become a middle-income country. High levels by 2030 and high income countries by 2050.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the policy of the Royal Government in all mandates is to make the country more prosperous by making the people grow, reducing poverty and improving living standards.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet stated that 20 years after the peace, the Royal Government has made efforts to change the lives of the people from poor to middle and middle income to high income.
* President Hun Manet stated that it is unfortunate that the Kovid 19 crisis and the inflation crisis have reduced the economic and living conditions of the people, but the Royal Government does not sit and mourn and try to solve all those problems.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that helping the people is helping the national economy. Samdech added that the national economy can not be stable if the people's economy is not stable.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that the social protection program has benefited about 6.5 million people and costs $ 100 million per year.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet said that a country has a sustainable economy is to create a culture of people can feed themselves. But a country also has people who are unable to support themselves, which requires the government to intervene.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government not only has social protection programs, the Royal Government has also invested a lot in education, construction of infrastructure and electricity.
* President Hun Manet stated that the economic growth of 7% before Kovid 19 was not due to social protection policies, but to the achievements of social and economic development policies.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the policy of the new Royal Government continues to maintain the policy of social protection and the policy of the Royal Government does not abandon any citizen.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet praised the generosity and shared culture in Cambodian society.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that the six priority policies set by the Royal Government are ready to provide nearly $ 450 million to help the people.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that the social protection policy is to help people in the short term and enable them to survive in the long run.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that the policy of social protection does not create a culture of dependence, but rather the creation of a culture of ownership, helping people in times of trouble and helping to prevent living conditions from deteriorating.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that the delay in updating the population data makes the issuance of poor cards inaccurate according to the living conditions of the people.
* Samdech Hun Sen stated that although the Royal Government has considered and put in place comprehensive measures, Samdech would like to provide 15 additional recommendations to ensure the achievement of the Royal Government's strategic goals.
