According to the Ministry of Interior, as a principle and procedure for organizing the functions of public officials, if the relevant unit proposes to appoint a new position with a lower rank than the old position, the specialized unit must first prepare the procedure to terminate the old position with a higher position. Than just appointed a new position with a lower rank later.
