Along with this progress, if we look at the mindset of the people, we see that the development of the mindset of some people driving on the streets seems to be limited, has made the head of the Royal Government, Samdech Hun Sen. Concerned about the well-being of the people and called on people across the country to respect traffic laws to avoid loss of life or disability caused by traffic accidents on the road every day.
Mr. Rath Sandab continued that the request of the head of the Royal Government above really shows the Royal Government's concern for the lives and well-being of the people. Because the safety of the people is a common problem of the whole society, which requires the Royal Government and the people to work together to reduce and eliminate traffic accidents on the lives of people on this serious road. .
In other words, the Royal Government's measures to tighten traffic laws to solve the problem of traffic accidents are:
First, to reduce and eliminate the loss of life or injury caused by traffic accidents that cause pain to the husband or system, children, parents and blood relatives every day.
Second, in order to change the mindset of some Cambodian people who drive wild animals to turn to driving with ethics, politeness, respect, discipline to suit a nation, civilized, with a high civilization, noble as the blood of the empire. Because if some people continue to drive wildly, it shows a failure to build peace of mind.
Third, to attract investors and tourism, because the environment, safety, good order is very important for investors and tourism around the world.
In conclusion, Mr. Rath said that in order to avoid some people continue to drive wildly without order, the government should promote the dissemination of traffic laws on various media such as radio and television more widely. Because people are civilized, like to find good things for themselves, because self-development is a true national patriotism.
