(Kandal): The suspect in the murder of a 5-month-pregnant woman and burning the body and hijacking a motorcycle was charged by Ms. Thlang Srey Nuch, Prosecutor of Kandal Provincial Court, with "premeditated murder" under Article 200 Penal Code has already been sent to Investigating Judge Sou Panha.
Please be informed that the killer killed a 5-month-pregnant woman and used gasoline to burn the body and then took the victim's motorbike, which happened on January 14, 2024, at the northern forest point of Romlech village, Tuol Prech commune, Ang Snoul district, province. Kandal and found the body of the victim on January 21, 2024 at the above point was separated by the Kandal Provincial Armed Forces.
The story of the reason why the suspect killed the victim is that in the past, the suspect and the victim had the last love affair on January 14, 2024, before the incident, the suspect called each other. . The victim also agreed to meet after the meeting and the suspect was ready to kill the victim to take the motorcycle.
About an hour later, the two of them left the guesthouse to find a suitable place to kill the victim. Inadvertently, he used the hammock prepared in his pants pocket to pull the victim from behind and pull him upside down so that he could not move, and then the victim died immediately.
The suspect then dragged the victim into a nearby forest about 30 meters away, gathered grass and dead branches nearby, covered the victim's body, and rode the victim's motorcycle to buy a liter of gasoline. A metal trigger at a grocery store in Tuol Prech commune, Ang Snoul district, poured water on the victim's body and set the body on fire. The suspect then took the victim's motorcycle and fled to sell it around the Phnom Penh Depot Market.
In front of the police, the suspect, Ratana alias Keang, confessed that he really planned and prepared the materials in advance to kill the victim named Ry called Srey Moy. The reason is that they lose the game and owe a lot of money.
