Spokesperson of the Cabinet of Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet issued a press release on the outcome of the meeting between Samdech Thipadei and the President of the American Chamber of Commerce in Cambodia
On the occasion of the meeting, the President of the Chamber of Commerce expressed his deep gratitude to the President for taking the time to allow him and the delegation to pay a courtesy call and discuss work.
The President of the Chamber of Commerce also thanked the Royal Government of Cambodia for always facilitating and ensuring a good investment environment for US businesses in Cambodia, and highly appreciated the openness and excellent cooperation. Between Ministries and Institutions and the American Chamber of Commerce in Cambodia.
The President of the Chamber of Commerce also briefed the President on some of the activities of the American Chamber of Commerce (AmCham Cambodia), including the promotion of investment and trade relations between the United States and the Kingdom of Cambodia, the promotion of potential and Cambodian investment opportunities for American investors and helping to build the capacity and leadership of women entrepreneurs.
At the same time, the President of the Chamber of Commerce expressed his commitment to continue to strengthen and expand cooperation on attracting foreign direct investment (FDI) to Cambodia, the real estate business and support for women in small business ownership. Training and development of skills and finance.
In response, the President praised the good cooperation between the American Chamber of Commerce in Cambodia and the Royal Government of Cambodia, and thanked the American company for always believing and investing in Cambodia, which is a great contribution. Important for socio-economic development in Cambodia.
In addition, the President emphasized the attractiveness of the Investment Law of the Kingdom of Cambodia and the incentive policy for investors and businessmen, as well as the connection of Cambodia to the region and the world, which ensures the realism of the environment. Favorable and flexible investment.
The President wished the President of the American Chamber of Commerce and his colleagues success in their future missions.
