(Preah Sihanouk): Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province, on the afternoon of January 31, 2024, invited a procession of Buddha made of copper to be placed on the throne in Wat Kiri Chulsar, Koh Rong, Prek Svay Village, Koh Rong Sangkat, Koh Rong City. Preah Sihanouk Province, with the participation of monks, Deputy Governor, Governor of Koh Rong, Director of the Department of the Armed Forces and Buddhists, Sangkat Koh Rong, Koh Rong.
The procession of Buddha statues made of copper to be placed in the temple of Wat Kiri Chulsar Koh Rong in Prek Svay village, Koh Rong commune, Koh Rong city, Sihanoukville province for Buddhists near and far to worship in the Buddhist religion, which is the state religion.
To date, about 90 percent of the construction of this church is scheduled for completion in December 2024. On the other hand, the construction of this church will be sooner or later due to the proper preparation of the construction management committee, the preparation of maps and construction plans according to special rules, our team has the skills and techniques to build the church to make the construction process faster. Planning.
The construction of Wat Kiri Chulsar Koh Rong is another new achievement for Buddhists, national and international tourists to come and practice in the future, because this temple is built in the Khmer style.
It should be reminded that this copper Buddha statue was held on December 27, 2023 under the presidency of Lok Chumteav Samdech Krala Hom Nhem Sakhorn Sar Kheng and Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province. Pratil Village, Sangkat Preah Sre, Udong Mey Chey City, Kampong Speu Province.
This Buddha statue has the correct size and layout of the Buddha statue, built of copper, height from the forehead to the hairpin, height of 3,119 meters, length of the forehead is 2,772 meters, height of the lotus petals is 0.443 meters, weight 2 tons left for Buddhists in Koh Rong to worship.
The construction of Wat Kiri Chulsar in Prek Svay village, Koh Rong commune, Koh Rong city was initiated by Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng and Lok Chumteav for the people in the island area of Sihanoukville province.
